{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd8 Game Info</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Cat Story</strong> is a healing idle RPG that runs fixed at the bottom of your screen.<br>Earn resources through auto-battles with cute cats, and unlock new furniture and rooms!<br>Merge two cats to evolve them\u2014satisfy your urge to collect them all.<br>Even while you're working or studying, the cats keep moving and waiting for you.<br>Relax and enjoy a gentle experience with your feline friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/93c31e040995d40c8d42b8fdb486bc8c.poster.avif?t=1757915761\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/93c31e040995d40c8d42b8fdb486bc8c.webm?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/93c31e040995d40c8d42b8fdb486bc8c.mp4?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude3a Meet a Variety of Unique Cats!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From fur color and personality to abilities, every cat is full of charm!<br>Some are mischievous, some are big eaters\u2014each with their own quirks.<br>Collect them all and complete your adorable cat collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc4a Defeat Nightmares with Your Cats!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your cats to fend off nightmare monsters<br>so your owner can finally get a peaceful night\u2019s sleep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/791f3e24cec4c020fd732ae70c4f32f4.poster.avif?t=1757915761\" width=800 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/791f3e24cec4c020fd732ae70c4f32f4.webm?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/791f3e24cec4c020fd732ae70c4f32f4.mp4?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude91 Decorate the Room with Cute Furniture!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beds, toys, food bowls, and more!<br>Use the resources you collect to install adorable furniture and take care of your cats.<br>Design a cozy cat room that's all your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/c75c98fb896df8ba168b4eb8e2be3405.poster.avif?t=1757915761\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/c75c98fb896df8ba168b4eb8e2be3405.webm?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/c75c98fb896df8ba168b4eb8e2be3405.mp4?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf56 Care for the Cats in Your Room!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your hungry cats,<br>and clean up loose fur from time to time.<br>Bond with your feline companions as you share your daily life together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/f152139f65fa23393e898422429e7d40.poster.avif?t=1757915761\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/f152139f65fa23393e898422429e7d40.webm?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/f152139f65fa23393e898422429e7d40.mp4?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Merge and Evolve Your Cats!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge duplicate cats to evolve them into stronger, even cuter versions!<br>Enjoy both the thrill of growth and the fun of collecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/078c3a2bae400c1d4e5b8d1353d7fc19.poster.avif?t=1757915761\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/078c3a2bae400c1d4e5b8d1353d7fc19.webm?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/078c3a2bae400c1d4e5b8d1353d7fc19.mp4?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f A Game You Can Enjoy Beneath Your Desktop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a fixed structure at the bottom of the screen, you can take care of your cat friends at any time while surfing the Internet or working on documents. The game screen size can also be adjusted to your liking, so you can play healing games without interrupting your work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/69de951967e58925cafed915971c94ee.poster.avif?t=1757915761\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/69de951967e58925cafed915971c94ee.webm?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/69de951967e58925cafed915971c94ee.mp4?t=1757915761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803720?t=1757915761","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803720?t=1757915761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/df4a4ab6c400b5e87686925235a507a0769eb1bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757915761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/df4a4ab6c400b5e87686925235a507a0769eb1bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757915761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4004840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd8 Game Info</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Cat Story</strong> is a healing idle RPG that runs fixed at the bottom of your screen.<br>Earn resources through auto-battles with cute cats, and unlock new furniture and rooms!<br>